WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.268
For students, freshers and those starting their careers, a degree is a foundation.

00:00:05.624 --> 00:00:09.249
In an AI-shaped world, workplace readiness takes more.

00:00:09.678 --> 00:00:16.235
Ascend helps you discover suitable roles, identify skill gaps and practise realistic industry tasks.

00:00:16.566 --> 00:00:19.859
Its AI gives constructive feedback to improve each attempt.

00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:24.755
Prepare for interviews and build a professional identity backed by your work.

00:00:24.949 --> 00:00:29.656
Ascend helps you become job-ready and stand out in a crowded field of job seekers.

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:31.783
Colleges can focus their support.

00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:36.768
For employers facing thousands of applications, Ascend brings work artifacts,

00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:40.000
skill evidence and interview readiness into view.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:45.514
Its proposed Productivity Index connects role-specific readiness with supporting evidence,

00:00:45.514 --> 00:00:50.015
showing demonstrated capabilities and gaps still to develop.

00:00:50.306 --> 00:00:50.823
The aim:

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:54.955
clearer hiring decisions, with less time and cost to productivity.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:55.937
Ascend.

00:00:56.226 --> 00:00:59.457
A talent fulfilment network, bridging the productivity gap.
